<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Folder Flow — FTP Info</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-left">
      <a href="/" class="logo">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
          <path d="M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z"/>
        </svg>
        Folder Flow
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="topbar-right">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline">← Back</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container ftp-info-page">
    <% if (typeof successMsg !== 'undefined' && successMsg) { %>
      <div class="alert alert-success"><%= successMsg %></div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="info-cards">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h2>🌐 Web Access</h2>
        <p class="info-url"><%= webUrl %></p>
        <div class="qr-wrap">
          <img src="<%= webQR %>" alt="Web URL QR Code">
        </div>
        <p class="info-hint">Scan with your phone camera to open in browser</p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <h2>📂 FTP Access</h2>
        <p class="info-url"><%= ftpUrl %></p>
        <div class="qr-wrap">
          <img src="<%= ftpQR %>" alt="FTP URL QR Code">
        </div>
        <div class="ftp-credentials">
          <p><strong>Username:</strong> anything (any value works)</p>
          <p><strong>Password:</strong> your PIN</p>
        </div>
        <p class="info-hint">Use any FTP client (e.g., FileZilla, Cx File Explorer, Solid Explorer)</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PIN change (admin only) + network info side by side -->
    <div class="info-cards" style="margin-top:24px;">
      <% if (isAdmin) { %>
      <div class="info-card" style="text-align:left;">
        <h2>🔐 Change PINs</h2>
        <form method="POST" action="/change-pin">
          <div style="margin-bottom:12px;">
            <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);">Current Admin PIN</label>
            <input type="password" name="currentPin" required class="input" style="margin-top:4px;">
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom:12px;">
            <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);">New Admin PIN</label>
            <input type="password" name="newAdminPin" required minlength="4" maxlength="20" class="input" style="margin-top:4px;">
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom:12px;">
            <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);">New User PIN</label>
            <input type="password" name="newUserPin" required minlength="4" maxlength="20" class="input" style="margin-top:4px;">
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Update PINs</button>
        </form>
        <% if (typeof pinError !== 'undefined' && pinError) { %>
          <div class="alert alert-error" style="margin-top:12px;"><%= pinError %></div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
      <% } %>

      <% if (networkInfo) { %>
      <div class="info-card" style="text-align:left;">
        <h2>🖧 Network Info</h2>
        <div class="ftp-credentials">
          <p><strong>Environment:</strong> <%= networkInfo.envLabel %></p>
          <p><strong>LAN IP:</strong> <%= networkInfo.lanIP %></p>
          <% if (networkInfo.wslIP) { %>
            <p><strong>WSL Internal IP:</strong> <%= networkInfo.wslIP %></p>
          <% } %>
        </div>
        <% if (networkInfo.isWSL2) { %>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;padding:12px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:13px;">
            <p style="color:var(--danger);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">⚠️ WSL2 — Port forwarding required</p>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px;">Run in Admin PowerShell:</p>
            <code style="font-size:11px;word-break:break-all;color:var(--text);">netsh interface portproxy add v4tov4 listenport=<%= port %> listenaddress=0.0.0.0 connectport=<%= port %> connectaddress=<%= networkInfo.wslIP %></code>
          </div>
        <% } else if (networkInfo.isWSL) { %>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;padding:12px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:13px;">
            <p style="color:var(--success);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">✅ WSL1 — No port forwarding needed</p>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted);">If phone can't connect, run in Admin PowerShell:</p>
            <code style="font-size:11px;word-break:break-all;color:var(--text);">netsh advfirewall firewall add rule name="FolderFlow" dir=in action=allow protocol=TCP localport=<%= port %>,<%= ftpPort %></code>
          </div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="ftp-help">
      <h3>📱 Solid Explorer (Android) — Step by Step</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Open <strong>Solid Explorer</strong> → tap the <strong>☰ hamburger menu</strong> (top-left)</li>
        <li>Scroll down, tap <strong>⊕ (plus)</strong> or <strong>"New cloud connection"</strong></li>
        <li>Select <strong>FTP</strong> from the list</li>
        <li>Fill in:
          <ul style="margin-top:6px;">
            <li><strong>Host:</strong> <code><%= ftpUrl.replace('ftp://', '').split(':')[0] %></code></li>
            <li><strong>Port:</strong> <code><%= ftpUrl.split(':').pop() %></code></li>
            <li><strong>Username:</strong> <code>user</code> (any text works)</li>
            <li><strong>Password:</strong> your PIN (default: <code>1234</code>)</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Next</strong> → <strong>Connect</strong></li>
        <li>You'll see your shared files — browse, copy, move freely!</li>
      </ol>

      <h3 style="margin-top:24px;">📱 Other Apps</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Install an FTP-capable file manager:<br>
          <strong>Android:</strong> Cx File Explorer, Total Commander<br>
          <strong>iOS:</strong> FE File Explorer, Documents by Readdle
        </li>
        <li>Add a new FTP connection with the address above</li>
        <li>Enter any username and your PIN as password</li>
        <li>Browse, download, and upload files</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
